{"id":"einzelheit","lemma":"Einzelheit","pos":"noun","rank":3454,"glosses":["detail"],"ipa":"/ˈaɪ̯ntsl̩haɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6d/De-Einzelheit.ogg/De-Einzelheit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Einzelheit","plural":"Einzelheiten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich kenne alle Einzelheiten.","en":"I know all the details.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"kennen"},{"g":"all, everyone"},null]},{"text":"Wir haben alle Einzelheiten.","en":"We have all the details.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"all, everyone"},null]},{"text":"Ich brauche die Einzelheiten nicht.","en":"I don't need the details.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Ich muss nicht alle Einzelheiten wissen.","en":"I don't have to know all the details.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"all, everyone"},null,{"g":"to know"}]},{"text":"Ich will die ganze Geschichte hören. Lass keine Einzelheit aus!","en":"I want to hear the whole story. Don't skip any details.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"entire","l":"ganz"},{"g":"history"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)"},{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]}]}